{"seq":11,"trial_id":"gbrain-ladder-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-verbs-told-mu-heldout/sd-05-kwame-dm-digest/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-25T03:16:03.541Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"fdeb30b4783648f2ea53c115aae85e6f6abab5a583d36f4bd9dfd6d01b483d9d","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DGBRAIN0002","text":"Hi Kwame, I can't set up the recurring 09:00 digest. My scheduler runs jobs in a separate session with no link back to this workspace, so a scheduled job can't post into your DM here. What I can do is post a Coastal team digest to this DM whenever you ask, covering what's new in #coastal-team since your last one. Just say \"digest\" and I'll do it. Finance figures in #coastal-team will stay out of it unless you're the account owner for that account."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DGBRAIN0002","ts":"1791986400.000126"}}
